      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-12-14T23:19:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't know if it's the same issue, but I've found that Safari on my Mac caches the page that says \"Access Denied\" so that after I login correctly and try to go back to that same page, it shows me the cached \"Access Denied\" page again. &nbsp;But like jagarciao says, if I refresh, it figures out that the situation has changed and shows me the proper page.</p>",
